    "title": "Louisiana State Police involved in vehicle pursuit that ended around Goodwood Boulevard, Airline Highway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adam Burruss ,\n2 hours ago BATON ROUGE — Louisiana State Police troopers were involved in a vehicle pursuit that ended around Goodwood Boulevard and Airline Highway, officials said. LSP and Baton Rouge Police Department vehicles were seen along those streets and the Tara subdivision Thursday afternoon. No other information was given regarding the pursuit or what led to it. Read full article\n2",
